{"product":{"id":9698250653984,"title":"Terreno PRO T60 Mixed Gravel Race","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eWith its proven V-formation design and uniform tread profile, the Terreno PRO T60 Mixed Gravel Race offers confident cornering and consistent handling in every situation. Surface siping and balanced tread spacing ensure reliable grip on mixed gravel conditions, striking the perfect harmony between speed, control, and versatility.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut performance alone wasn’t enough. Every Terreno PRO is built with 92% renewable and recycled materials, making it the most sustainable tire Vittoria has ever created. Compared to the average competitor, it is 7% faster, 9% grippier, and 34% more puncture resistant, showcasing performance and sustainability without compromise.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompared to the Gravel Endurance construction, the new PRO one achieves an average carbon footprint reduction of 35% (based on a 2024 modelling scenario), showing that sustainability and speed can ride side by side. Awarded at the Taipei Cycle Show 2024, this tire represents the new era of cycling.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"Gravel Tire","created_at":"2024-11-06T02:28:57-06:00","handle":"terreno-pro-t60-tubeless-ready","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:18-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-11T10:17:17-06:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"Discounted products, EP70, Gravel, Gravel Race, IPP40, Sitewide, Tires","variants":[{"id":49480791851296,"product_id":9698250653984,"title":"700x35c \/ Brown","price":"112.99","sku":"11A00849","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"700x35c","option2":"Brown","option3":null,"created_at":"2024-11-06T04:28:42-06:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T08:36:18-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530037433","grams":550,"image_id":47548230140192,"weight":550.0,"weight_unit":"g","tax_code":"","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_ru